%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5ba88017b323d2ea295e0a454dc00b86, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogDefinitions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ashworld.DialogDefinitions
  lines:
  - title: Jossen Viersen - I wouldn't go in there, friend. Not sure what's in there,
      but if the engulfs don't like it, I don't either.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afeb6b92552fdf8b394b4161f03e4285, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    otherConditions: []
    text: I wouldn't go in there, friend. Not sure what's in there, but if the engulfs
      don't like it, I don't either.
  - title: Jossen Viersen - Technically only half of what I said was a lie. I really
      did think we could be allies.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2b75bd41a40ebac8eb263cb1bb952e70, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    otherConditions: []
    text: Technically only half of what I said was a lie. I really did think we could
      be allies.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - I've never been for dallying, not even when I was your
      age; the sooner we get beyond this city, the sooner we can start serving the
      Liberator-Daughter. Let's set out.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 00000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6482391e3e4fde594b828b85f0c8a495, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: I've never been for dallying, not even when I was your age; the sooner
      we get beyond this city, the sooner we can start serving the Liberator-Daughter.
      Let's set out.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - Whoever these herretics are, it seems they've come to
      harass us. We'll muscle past them same as anyone else.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 0000000001000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 512aa2ceb4f74c7a7960fecadda29cdf, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: Whoever these herretics are, it seems they've come to harass us. We'll
      muscle past them same as anyone else.
  - title: Sir Brighteyes - Don't worry about me; it's not my job to stop you from
      leaving. Apply yourself and travel well.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8404180b17b50f407bb80203d8858a01, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aa82e4737592fcd0b851045d232e53c6, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 01000000
    text: Don't worry about me; it's not my job to stop you from leaving. Apply yourself
      and travel well.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - Ah so we found our first monsters of the quest. Griffin's
      won't harry us if we march on with confidence. Let's keep applying ourselves.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 00000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1dd9dd848d82f9978d8418c18ba65f2, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: Ah so we found our first monsters of the quest. Griffin's won't harry us
      if we march on with confidence. Let's keep applying ourselves.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - These hooligans, however, seem set on blocking our way.
      We might be able to push past them with numbers alone, but it would be easier
      if we took out their leader.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 0000000001000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 36f3baeace9914a3c928abe29a563c41, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: These hooligans, however, seem set on blocking our way. We might be able
      to push past them with numbers alone, but it would be easier if we took out
      their leader.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - Whoever these dwarves are, it seems they've come to harass
      us. We'll muscle past them same as anyone else.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 0000000001000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 512aa2ceb4f74c7a7960fecadda29cdf, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: Whoever these dwarves are, it seems they've come to harass us. We'll muscle
      past them same as anyone else.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - Someone's overrun the outer bulwarks! Let us send some
      of our retainers to help in the defense, or who knows what threat they'll pose
      to the Empire.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 0000000001000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 342315741d421c1a6954df6af85ef946, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 05000000
    text: Someone's overrun the outer bulwarks! Let us send some of our retainers
      to help in the defense, or who knows what threat they'll pose to the Empire.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - It looks like we're not the only Knights-Errant to run
      into this brigands. Let's let a hand to our comrades.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 0000000001000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 395b8de3acf10ad73b27c7a8715a12ae, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: It looks like we're not the only Knights-Errant to run into this brigands.
      Let's let a hand to our comrades.
  - title: Imperial Stallwart - Ah, thank the Liberator-Daughter! and thank you for
      my rescue!
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 495ee94677c0a784196be489e9cacc77, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 00000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 395b8de3acf10ad73b27c7a8715a12ae, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: Ah, thank the Liberator-Daughter! and thank you for my rescue!
  - title: Imperial Stallwart - Hey! You in the red! Whatever skulkery you're doing,
      there's no worse city to try and do it in. Scram!
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 495ee94677c0a784196be489e9cacc77, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 05000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 512aa2ceb4f74c7a7960fecadda29cdf, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    text: Hey! You in the red! Whatever skulkery you're doing, there's no worse city
      to try and do it in. Scram!
  - title: Sir Athrenwen - Does a Knight-Ashtiden get as little respect in the Imperial
      City as she gets in the Protectorates?
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c88c366bb6eca5b688430c9fb32ce0a4, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 495ee94677c0a784196be489e9cacc77, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 05000000
    text: Does a Knight-Ashtiden get as little respect in the Imperial City as she
      gets in the Protectorates?
  - title: Sir Athrenwen - The Empire was awefully keen to keep me here during my
      squirehood, and now that I've slain a few Dragondorn for it I can't even come
      and visit?
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c88c366bb6eca5b688430c9fb32ce0a4, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 495ee94677c0a784196be489e9cacc77, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 05000000
    text: The Empire was awefully keen to keep me here during my squirehood, and
      now that I've slain a few Dragondorn for it I can't even come and visit?
  - title: Sir Athrenwen - With every knight I meet in passing, the more I think
      I'm the only one of us going east and not west.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3cf9d3a219d156b0857d4784b4bd76a, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 01000000
    text: With every knight I meet in passing, the more I think I'm the only one
      of us going east and not west.
  - title: Sir Ersdotter - It's always nice to meet a Knight-Ashtiden; you lot tell
      such interesting stories. That cape of yours though, and that sword...
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e2ced9b3a0f6c72ea1fa8560dfac792, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 01000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3cf9d3a219d156b0857d4784b4bd76a, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 02000000
    text: It's always nice to meet a Knight-Ashtiden; you lot tell such interesting
      stories. That cape of yours though, and that sword...
  - title: Sir Athrenwen - You oafs have been able to whorship the Mother of Dragons
      all this time under Imperial noses with this little grace? It's this easy?
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c88c366bb6eca5b688430c9fb32ce0a4, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 512aa2ceb4f74c7a7960fecadda29cdf, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    text: You oafs have been able to whorship the Mother of Dragons all this time
      under Imperial noses with this little grace? It's this easy?
  - title: Cultist - Eh, yup. Never thought I'd being doing it alongside someone
      with that bird on her chest though.
    speaker:
      cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 512aa2ceb4f74c7a7960fecadda29cdf, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    otherConditions:
    - cardAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c88c366bb6eca5b688430c9fb32ce0a4, type: 2}
      allowedZones: 04000000
    text: Eh, yup. Never thought I'd being doing it alongside someone with that bird
      on her chest though.
